      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "8:00PM Concert 7:15PM Musical Insights with Alexina Louie &amp; Guests  This final concert of Esprit’s 40th Anniversary Season will commence with an evocation of Spring, with Esprit joined by violinist Aaron Schwebel to perform Max Richter’s ingeniously re-imagined  Spring  movements from Vivald"
      }
